data: {"runId":"run-7b90ddb0-9d8b-43cb-870a-22fdd0e4fd31","status":"FINISHED","text":"OpenAgents’s Cloud Agent environment is tested and ready to save.\n\n**What was done**\n- Mapped the workspace to the pinned Rust 1.97.1 toolchain and the day-to-day `cargo test -p` plus `cargo fmt` flow.\n- Installed the native build packages (`protoc`, OpenSSL, SQLite, libclang, `bubblewrap`) and fetched the root workspace crates.\n- Ran trajectory, lease-broker, and Nostr signature tests on this machine.\n- Snapshotted that disk, built it, and confirmed the same toolchain in a fresh Cloud Agent.\n\n#### Validation\n| Check | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| ATIF trajectory documents | 56 library tests, 3 integration tests, and 1 doctest passed |\n| Lease broker | 66 library tests, holder recovery, and 5 cargo-shim tests passed |\n| Nostr signed agreement | `free_agreement_requires_both_signatures_exact_terms_and_confirmation` passed |\n| `cargo fmt` for those crates | Clean |\n| Install idempotence | Passed twice |\n| Fresh Cloud Agent | [Build verification](bc-3a90601a-d753-5a94-8be4-6fb84bda6279) booted from `bld-20261008-26522d23-d3aa-427c-b6f2-3fc6ffbabdb8`: Rust 1.97.1, rustfmt, Clippy, Python 3.12.3, protoc 3.21.12, OpenSSL 3.0.13, SQLite 3.45.1, bubblewrap 0.9.0; `cargo fetch --locked --offline` exited 0; the corrupt lease-table test passed |\n\n#### Action required\n**Click Save in the Environment panel on the right.**\n\nThis makes the tested setup available to future Cloud Agents. Nothing else is required.\n\n`AGENTS.md` now records the Cloud Agent toolchain, the `~/work/openagents-target-agentN` output directory, and `CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2` for large crates. Merging that change preserves the guidance for future agents. The phone workspace lock file still does not resolve with `cargo fetch --locked`, and relay release checks still need PostgreSQL.","durationMs":1632874,"git":{"branches":[{"repoUrl":"github.com/OpenAgentsInc/openagents","branch":"cursor/cloud-agent-env-notes-58b0","prUrl":"https://github.com/OpenAgentsInc/openagents/pull/10979"}]}}

